he cofactor expansion along the first row:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(S) & ={s}_{11}{C}_{11}+{s}_{12}{C}_{12}+{s}_{13}{C}_{13}+{s}_{14}{C}_{14} \\\\  & =0\\cdot {C}_{11}+2\\cdot {C}_{12}+0\\cdot {C}_{13}+0\\cdot {C}_{14} \\\\  & =2{C}_{12} \\\\  & =2\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}∗ & 2 & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ 1 & ∗ & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & ∗ & -5 & 4 \\\\ 4 & ∗ & 2 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2(-1)^{1+2}|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -5 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 2 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-2(1\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-5 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 2\\end{aligned}|-0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{aligned}|+0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{aligned}|) \\\\  & =-2((-5\\cdot 2-4\\cdot 2)-0+0) \\\\  & =-2\\cdot (-18) \\\\  & =36\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-32727/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "055b3809-f9aa-5dcc-8c1a-b0eb71020d7e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-32727"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-32791/selection/eaa0ff3d0e34bf4cc56606f08b4c540c17a85ab3f394397b4f1f6fe3c6d48656" :answer/id #uuid "1e07b9ad-bd0a-5ad9-ae44-a16f85e8e46a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "108" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-32791/selection/5aa7d5a70efa831a31e6b82f10565bd69bbaa8c894b8c1ee39d98f5fac58a077" :answer/id #uuid "8ee87210-5b1d-52d3-bfb2-f887ae2ebb6d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-108" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-32791/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer/id #uuid "da8ec3d6-8915-5e60-ac59-b1b5152f0306" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-32791/selection/c0a652c0f3085d1fe390fbfbe6817f72b49b55d69b568c75ffcf3de5122dc6a1" :answer/id #uuid "3d1161e4-480f-5ec6-a7e1-7e3761bc7952" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-198" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-32791/selection/2a66008d2dd82e18f69936dbbddebf